# Verifier has no runtime of its own — the guard is pure bash + git.
# This file exists so tooling can detect the project root. Nothing to fill in.
#
# Never commit a real .env. Platform SecretOps is Cerulean Vault (HashiCorp
# Vault, KV v2, hosted by Cerulean); Cerulean also owns DNS + TLS. Verifier
# consumes no secrets itself — the posture is stated so the portfolio has one rule.
